<title>USA: First Carnegie sells 1,035,000 shares.</title>
<headline>First Carnegie sells 1,035,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>CARNEGIE, Pa. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Carnegie Deposit said Friday it sold 1,035,000 shares of common stock in a minority offering for gross proceeds of $10.35 million.</p>
<p>Skibo Bancshares MHC, the bank's new mutual holding company, acquired 1,265,000 or 55 percent of the outstanding shares, First Carnegie said.</p>
